WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.023 --> 00:00:09.041
Ivy felt bad. "A skunk sprayed Glen? That's terrible!"

2
00:00:09.042 --> 00:00:13.627
"Yes," Annie said, "but it was his own fault.

3
00:00:13.628 --> 00:00:17.638
He kept showing off, acting like a wildlife expert."

4
00:00:17.639 --> 00:00:22.925
Ivy nodded. She could picture exactly what Annie meant.

5
00:00:22.926 --> 00:00:27.162
After everyone returned their trays, Ivy turned to Ezra.

6
00:00:27.163 --> 00:00:30.455
"Glen must be embarrassed about the skunk incident.

7
00:00:30.456 --> 00:00:33.624
Maybe he'll be back to his old self."

8
00:00:33.625 --> 00:00:38.314
Ezra made a face. "I doubt it!"

9
00:00:38.315 --> 00:00:42.211
*** The next day Glen wasn't at morning

10
00:00:42.212 --> 00:00:46.041
assembly. After the assembly, Ezra followed

11
00:00:46.042 --> 00:00:48.991
Ivy. "Wait, Ivy!" Ezra

12
00:00:48.992 --> 00:00:51.980
said. "Glen's still acting

13
00:00:51.981 --> 00:00:57.806
weird. And now he's upset because he has a

14
00:00:57.807 --> 00:01:01.215
nickname—Stinky!" Ivy couldn't stop herself from

15
00:01:01.216 --> 00:01:03.927
grinning. "It's funny," Ezra

16
00:01:03.928 --> 00:01:09.090
said. "But I'm actually worried about him. Can you come with

17
00:01:09.091 --> 00:01:14.582
me?"

18
00:01:14.583 --> 00:01:18.897
"Sure." They found Glen sitting on his bunk, his head

19
00:01:18.898 --> 00:01:24.056
down. Ivy sniffed the air. "It smells like skunk in here."

20
00:01:24.057 --> 00:01:29.634
Glen shrugged. "The nurse gave me something to wash off the skunk spray.

21
00:01:29.635 --> 00:01:32.374
But it still stinks."

22
00:01:32.375 --> 00:01:36.707
"And why weren't you at morning assembly?" Ivy asked.

23
00:01:36.708 --> 00:01:41.582
"Because I'm never, ever leaving this cabin," Glen said.

24
00:01:41.583 --> 00:01:46.624
"And when camp ends, I'm never, ever coming back."

25
00:01:46.625 --> 00:01:50.541
"But you love Camp Evergreen," Ivy said.

26
00:01:50.542 --> 00:01:54.285
"Not anymore." Glen shook his head.

27
00:01:54.286 --> 00:02:01.041
"Once I thought I would be a legend. Now I'm nothing but a joke."

28
00:02:01.042 --> 00:02:04.332
Glen took a sheet of paper off his shelf.

29
00:02:04.333 --> 00:02:08.878
"Ezra, I wrote the comedy routine for you and Wes.

30
00:02:08.879 --> 00:02:15.791
I'm not participating, though. Everyone's already laughing at me. "

31
00:02:15.792 --> 00:02:19.416
Soon Ivy and Ezra left.

32
00:02:19.417 --> 00:02:21.478
Ivy shook her head.

33
00:02:21.479 --> 00:02:26.749
"Glen can't stop coming to camp, Ezra. He loves it here."

34
00:02:26.750 --> 00:02:31.999
"I know." Ezra started scanning Glen's script.

35
00:02:32.000 --> 00:02:37.000
"And as bad as Glen feels, he still helped me out.

36
00:02:37.001 --> 00:02:42.124
Some of this is actually funny. Maybe our act will be okay."

37
00:02:42.125 --> 00:02:46.600
"Hmm." Ivy suddenly had an idea.

38
00:02:46.601 --> 00:02:53.325
"Well, I think my act is about to change."

39
