43
00:03:07.219 --> 00:03:11.387
attend. Onstage Wes and Ezra were pretending to

44
00:03:11.388 --> 00:03:16.749
argue. When it was Wes' turn to speak, he tooted his bugle instead of

45
00:03:16.750 --> 00:03:20.561
talking. "What did you say?" Ezra

46
00:03:20.562 --> 00:03:24.541
yelled. Wes tooted back, and the crowd

47
00:03:24.542 --> 00:03:28.666
laughed. "That was pretty funny!" Ivy thought,

48
00:03:28.667 --> 00:03:32.541
grinning. Vampyre was the last group to

49
00:03:32.542 --> 00:03:35.603
perform. Backstage, Willow looked

50
00:03:35.604 --> 00:03:41.416
nervous. "We shouldn't have changed our song. The first one was

51
00:03:41.417 --> 00:03:44.926
great." "The new act is fine," Clara

52
00:03:44.927 --> 00:03:50.757
said. "And we're doing a good deed. People will love

53
00:03:50.758 --> 00:03:56.627
it!" "As long as I remember the dance steps," Ivy thought, walking onstage.

54
00:03:56.628 --> 00:04:05.249
She looked at the crowd. "This song is for someone we all know . . . Glen!"

55
00:04:05.250 --> 00:04:06.983
We know a guy,

56
00:04:06.984 --> 00:04:09.495
Some called him a zero.

57
00:04:09.496 --> 00:04:10.965
But we don't lie,

58
00:04:10.966 --> 00:04:13.470
He's really a hero.

59
00:04:13.471 --> 00:04:14.726
He helps his friends,

60
00:04:14.727 --> 00:04:16.885
He saved Mango, too, Yeah!

61
00:04:16.885 --> 00:04:17.812
Shout out to Glen!

62
00:04:17.813 --> 00:04:20.171
He's a hero,

63
00:04:20.172 --> 00:04:30.512
Oh-oh-oh-oh!

64
00:04:30.513 --> 00:04:34.832
The crowd jumped to their feet, clapping and laughing.

65
00:04:34.833 --> 00:04:38.353
Then Private walked onstage with a trophy.

66
00:04:38.354 --> 00:04:46.593
"First place goes to Vampyre. The audience loved your act."

67
00:04:46.594 --> 00:04:50.332
Clara took the trophy and they all bowed.

68
00:04:50.333 --> 00:04:56.694
Glen rushed up to them, grinning. "That is such a cool song!"

69
00:04:56.695 --> 00:05:00.030
"Ivy wrote it," Clara said.

70
00:05:00.031 --> 00:05:03.137
"Thanks, Ivy," Glen said.

71
00:05:03.138 --> 00:05:08.168
"I guess I have some good friends here." He lowered his voice.

72
00:05:08.169 --> 00:05:12.288
"But nobody really called me a 'zero.' Did they?"

73
00:05:12.289 --> 00:05:23.586
"No," Ivy said. "Because you're number one. Right, Stinky?"

